Maandishi ikija: ['html'] fanya: { <- (
		binafsi
		badilisha: ['&'] kwa: ['&amp;'],
		badilisha: ['<'] kwa: ['&lt;'],
		badilisha: ['>'] kwa: ['&gt;'],
		badilisha: ['"'] kwa: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Orodha mpya.

['Verbatim Syntax'] herufi-zote kila: { :nambari :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (nambari), Letter: letter).
}.

Towe list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list unganisha: ['↵']).

Towe andika: template.

